EEXXAAMMPPLLEESS
           bar.com foo

     Trust user “foo” from host “bar.com”.

           +@allclient

     Trust all hosts from netgroup “allclient”.

           +@allclient -@dau

     Trust all hosts from netgroup “allclient” and their users except users
     from netgroup “dau”.

